@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms & Conditions";
}
<!-- Global Styles -->
<link rel="stylesheet"
      href="~/css/legal/mas-legal.css"
      asp-append-version="true" />
<div class="mas-legal-page">

    <div class="mas-legal-header">
        <span class="mas-legal-eyebrow">CUSTOMER INFORMATION</span>
        <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
        <p>
            Please read these terms before making a booking
            with MAS Cleaners.
        </p>
        <span class="mas-legal-updated">
            Last updated: 12 November 2026
        </span>
    </div>

    <div class="mas-legal-content">

        <section>
            <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
            <p>
                These Terms and Conditions govern the use of the
                MAS Cleaners website and the booking of cleaning
                services through our platform.
            </p>
            <p>
                By creating an account, placing a booking or using
                our services, you agree to these Terms and Conditions,
                subject to your rights under applicable South African law.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>2. Bookings and Service Requests</h2>
            <p>
                Customers may use the MAS Cleaners website to
                select services, provide the required information
                and submit cleaning bookings.
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    Customers must provide accurate contact details,
                    including their name, surname, email address
                    and telephone number.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Customers must provide a complete and accurate
                    address for the premises where the service
                    will be performed.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Company customers must provide accurate company
                    and invoicing information where applicable.
                </li>
                <li>
                    Customers are responsible for checking their
                    booking details before submitting a request.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                A booking is subject to review and confirmation by
                MAS Cleaners. Submission of a booking request does
                not, by itself, guarantee that the requested service
                or time slot is available.
            </p>
            <p>
                We will communicate relevant booking updates
                through the contact details provided by the customer.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>3. Customer Responsibilities</h2>
            <p>
                Customers are expected to:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>Provide accurate booking and contact information.</li>
                <li>Ensure the service address is accessible at the agreed time.</li>
                <li>Provide reasonable access to the premises where work is required.</li>
                <li>Communicate any relevant service instructions in advance.</li>
                <li>Notify MAS Cleaners of any changes that may affect the booking.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>4. Booking Prices and Invoices</h2>
            <p>
                Service prices are displayed on the website or
                communicated by MAS Cleaners during the booking
                process.
            </p>
            <p>
                Customers should review the selected services,
                quantities and applicable charges before confirming
                a booking.
            </p>
            <p>
                Company customers may provide their company name
                and VAT registration number, where applicable,
                for invoicing purposes.
            </p>
            <p>
                Any VAT treatment will be reflected on the invoice
                in accordance with MAS Cleaners' applicable
                registration status and South African tax law.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>5. Payment Methods</h2>
            <p>
                MAS Cleaners provides the following payment options:
            </p>

            <h3>5.1 Online Payment</h3>
            <p>
                Customers may pay online through our Paystack
                payment integration. Online transactions are
                subject to the applicable payment provider's
                terms and processing requirements.
            </p>

            <h3>5.2 Electronic Funds Transfer (EFT)</h3>
            <p>
                Customers may select EFT as a payment method.
                Applicable payment instructions will be provided
                by MAS Cleaners.
            </p>

            <h3>5.3 Card Payment on Service Delivery</h3>
            <p>
                Customers may select card payment on service
                delivery, subject to the payment facilities
                available at the time of service.
            </p>

            <h3>5.4 Cash on Service Delivery</h3>
            <p>
                Customers may select cash payment on service
                delivery.
            </p>

            <p>
                Customers are responsible for ensuring that
                payment is made using the selected payment
                arrangement and in accordance with the
                instructions communicated by MAS Cleaners.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>6. Unpaid Bookings and Cancellations</h2>
            <p>
                Customers may cancel an unpaid booking directly
                through their customer profile.
            </p>
            <p>
                Once the cancellation has been successfully
                processed, the booking will be updated accordingly.
                Customers should check their booking history
                to confirm its cancellation status.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>7. Paid Booking Cancellations and Refunds</h2>
            <p>
                Customers who wish to cancel a paid booking should
                contact MAS Cleaners to request cancellation and
                a refund assessment.
            </p>

            <h3>7.1 Administration Fee</h3>
            <p>
                For eligible cancellations of paid bookings,
                MAS Cleaners' standard cancellation administration
                fee is 10% of the amount otherwise refundable.
            </p>
            <p>
                The administration fee is subject to applicable
                South African consumer-protection laws and must
                be reasonable in the circumstances. Relevant
                factors may include the nature of the service,
                the notice given before the scheduled service
                and the possibility of allocating the booking
                to another customer.
            </p>
            <p>
                The fee will not be charged where its application
                would conflict with a customer's statutory
                cancellation or refund rights.
            </p>

            <h3>7.2 Refund Processing</h3>
            <p>
                Once a cancellation and refund have been approved,
                MAS Cleaners aims to process the applicable refund
                within five (5) working days.
            </p>
            <p>
                The time taken for the refunded funds to reflect
                in the customer's account may depend on the
                relevant bank, payment provider or financial
                institution.
            </p>
            <p>
                All refunds will be handled in accordance with
                applicable South African laws and any relevant
                statutory refund periods.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>8. Changes to Bookings</h2>
            <p>
                Customers who need to change their booking details
                or scheduled service should contact MAS Cleaners
                as soon as possible.
            </p>
            <p>
                Requests to change a booking are subject to
                availability and confirmation by MAS Cleaners.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>9. Service Delivery</h2>
            <p>
                MAS Cleaners will make reasonable efforts to
                provide the selected services in accordance
                with the confirmed booking details.
            </p>
            <p>
                Customers should ensure that the premises are
                accessible and that the service personnel can
                reasonably perform the agreed work.
            </p>
            <p>
                If circumstances arise that may affect service
                delivery, the customer should be informed using
                the contact details supplied with the booking.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>10. Personal Information and POPIA</h2>
            <p>
                MAS Cleaners collects and processes customer
                information in accordance with the Protection
                of Personal Information Act 4 of 2013 (POPIA).
            </p>
            <p>
                Information may be used to manage accounts,
                process bookings, deliver services, prepare
                invoices, process payments and communicate
                with customers.
            </p>
            <p>
                For further information about how we handle
                personal information and the rights available
                to customers, please read our
                <a asp-controller="Legal"
                   asp-action="PrivacyPolicy">
                    Privacy Policy
                </a>.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>11. Applicable Law and Consumer Rights</h2>
            <p>
                These Terms and Conditions are governed by
                the laws of the Republic of South Africa.
            </p>
            <p>
                Nothing in these terms is intended to exclude,
                restrict or limit any consumer right that
                cannot lawfully be excluded or limited under
                applicable legislation, including the
                Consumer Protection Act 68 of 2008 and the
                Electronic Communications and Transactions
                Act 25 of 2002.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>12. Changes to These Terms</h2>
            <p>
                MAS Cleaners may update these Terms and
                Conditions when necessary to reflect changes
                to our services, payment arrangements or
                legal obligations.
            </p>
            <p>
                The latest version will be published on this page.
                Customers are encouraged to review these terms
                periodically.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>13. Contact MAS Cleaners</h2>
            <p>
                For questions about bookings, payments,
                cancellations, refunds or these Terms and
                Conditions, please contact us:
            </p>

            <div class="mas-legal-contact">
                <p>
                    <strong>Email:</strong>
                    <a href="mailto:info@mascleaners.co.za">
                        info@mascleaners.co.za
                    </a>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Telephone:</strong>
                    <a href="tel:+27614908391">
                        +27 61 490 8391
                    </a>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Service area:</strong>
                    Free State, South Africa
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>
</div>
